SUMMARY:Third Friday with our Local Artists!
DESCRIPTION:Carrie Richardson\, owner and artist behind BrightKind Creative\, hails from Oklahoma\, but has called North Carolina home for half her life. As a mom of three with a love for punny jokes\, arts and crafts\, and environmental protection\, Carrie channels her passions into her work. Her unique designs feature watercolor and gouache\, acrylic paintings\, and distinctive hand lettering. Through BrightKind Creative\, she brings joy and warmth to homes worldwide with meaningful and fun artwork. BrightKind’s product range includes art prints\, paintings\, greeting cards\, coffee mugs\, shirts\, dish towels\, stickers\, and seasonal items.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/third-friday-with-our-local-artists/
