DESCRIPTION:Every third Saturday at West End Billiards come test your skills in a double elimination challenge! Both league and non-league members are welcome.\nPractice starts at 1PM\, with matches starting at 2PM. \nEntry fee: $40\n1st place: 70%\n2nd place: 20%\n3rd place: 10% \nAll West End Rules:\n-Ball in hand\n-8 ball clean\n-Race to 4 \nEnjoy the challenge!
