SUMMARY:4 FT to Hell Annual Hot Dog Competition (for Charity!)\, Squatwurst Competition\, & More!
DESCRIPTION:2ND ANNUAL – Hot Dog Eating Competition (For Charity!)\, Squatwurst Competition\, Food Truck\, Photobooth\, Raffle\, and more! \nOUR GLORIOUS MARCH TO HELL kicks up Saturday\, July 18th from 1-6 pm. \nHot Dog Eating Competition @ 2 pm (details below\, Must sign up before the event to compete\, limited spots available. Proceeds from signups go to a nonprofit!)\nCompetitor Signup Link: https://shop.dssolvr.com/product/durham-competitor-ticket-2026/ \nSquatwurst Competition @ 3 pm (put on the hot dog on a string belt and see who can squat their dog into the buns the fastest. Winner takes home a big prize! Signups open at 1 pm\, free to compete and attend) \nHot Dog Prize Raffle Drawing @ 4 pm ($1/ticket available for purchase 1-4 pm. All proceeds go to Meals on Wheels of Durham Nonprofit) \nB-Dogs Food Truck 1-6 pm (on-site selling hot dogs and sausages w/ your choice of toppings!) \nHot Dog Photobooth (~Become the hot dog~) \nHot Dog Stickers and Coloring Book Pages (free until we run out! Two things adults and kids can agree upon.) \nSpecialty Cocktails all day (Details tbd) \nDrink Special ($2 off all Pitchers and Picklebacks all day) \n4 Feet to Hell Taproom Only Beer Release (American Light Lager) \nDRESS IN YOUR HOT DOG SWAG! (or don’t but also do) \nFear not\, our Annual Charity Hot Dog Eating Contest is almost upon us. Join DSSOLVR on Saturday\, July 18th from 1pm-6pm in celebrating the greasiest\, glizziest holiday of them all. \nPrepare yourselves for the hellish challenge of courage and gluttony as you embark on the journey to claim your GLIZZY GLORY. Are you daring enough to traverse the FOUR FEET to HELL? That’s right—FOUR\, FOOT-LONG HOTDOGS\, ONE PILS\, and one chance to emerge as the FOUR FEET to HELL CHAMPION! \nThe Challenge:All Eaters will battle against the relentless HELL CLOCK. You must devour your dogs and chug your PILS in under 6 minutes and 66 seconds. Should there be a tie\, prepare for the ultimate showdown—a tie-breaking game of FLIP CUP. \nThe Prize:The fastest challenger to conquer their Hell Dogs and drain their PILS will be crowned\, celebrated\, and hailed as the FFtH Champion. Succeed\, and your epic feat will be immortalized on our Champion Belt & the Wall of Flames– the Champion will bask in unimaginable prestige and seize the top prize! Fear not\, for we also honor the valiant 2nd and 3rd place contenders. \nEnter if you dare\, and may the bravest soul claim their place in the fiery halls of legend! 🔥🌭🌭🌭🌭🔥 \nONLY YOU CAN BECOME OUR NEXT CHAMPION!\nJoin us on 🌭Saturday\, July 18th 🌭 as we cheer on some of the most ambitious and insatiable challengers. With more prizes and more contestants\, and more hot diggity dogs! This year’s Four Feet to Hell is gonna be hella STUFFED! \nOur Challengers start their voyage to HELL at 2 PM SHARP! \nWitness the mind-blowing “Four Feet to Hell” Hotdog Eating Contest\, where fearless competitors battle for GLIZZY GLORY. Devouring 4x Foot-long Hot Dogs in just 6 minutes and 66 seconds (and 16oz of Beer!)\, they push their gastronomic limits to the extreme! To compete\, signup is required (details coming soon) but to attend is free! All proceeds from competitor signups and raffle tickets sold during the event benefit Meals on Wheels Durham . \nCompetitor Signup Link: https://shop.dssolvr.com/product/durham-competitor-ticket-2026/ \nLimited entries are available for those brave enough to take on the four-foot-long hotdog challenge! Contender tickets include \n$30 contender ticket includes:Four Feet to Hell limited edition shirt4 x Foot Long Hell Dogs from Chop Shop1 Pils1 can of Four Feet to Hell to-go$5 of your ticket will be donated to Manna Food BankA chance at Glizzy Glory! \nPrizes:\n1st place: FOUR FEET TO HELL CHAMPIONName listed on FFtH Championship BeltYour Name & Picture on the next can of Four Feet to HellYour Picture on Top of the Wall of Flames$100 DSSOLVR Gift Card1 DSSOLVR Shirt of Choice1 DSSOLVR Hat of Choice1 DSSOLVR Glass of ChoiceNamed FFtH Champion! \n2nd place:$50 DSSOLVR Gift Card1 DSSOLVR Shirt of Choice1 DSSOLVR Glass of choiceYour Picture on the Wall of Flames \n3rd place:$40 Gift Card1 DSSOLVR Glass of choiceYour Picture on the Wall of Flames \nBeat the Hell Clock:Your Picture on the Wall of Flames \nAs always\, we’ve got a special Beer to commemorate the occasion. This year\, however\, we decided to change up the recipe and go for something that screams “HOT DOG BEER” and nothing felt more appropriate than a special riff on American Lager. 100% @riverbendmalt ever-so-gently hopped\, fermented low and slow with our House Lager Yeast\, spunded for dat natural carbonation\, and Lagered for many moons in our Horizontal Tanks. Light\, crushable\, and delicious. Available on draft and in cans in BOTH TAPROOMS ONLY! NO DISTRO! \nCompetitor Signup Link: https://shop.dssolvr.com/product/durham-competitor-ticket-2026/
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/4-ft-to-hell-annual-hot-dog-competition-for-charity-squatwurst-competition-more/
